# Link events in place of long flows, with several throws to one catch.
# covers: §4.1, §5
title "Returns"

start Parcel returned
task Inspect parcel
xor Condition?
  good:
    task Restock items
    throw link Refund
  damaged:
    task Write off items
    throw link Refund
  else: end Rejected
catch link Refund
service Refund customer
end Refunded
